{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.MassTheory.BarParityClusterObstruction","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.MassTheory.BarParityClusterObstruction","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Hom.Defs","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.BarParityClusterObstruction.cumulant_barEven_of_symmetrized","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.BarParityClusterObstruction.cumulant_barEven_of_symmetrized","kind":"theorem","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/BarParityClusterObstruction.lean#L86-L92","doc":"**The fix (productive lead).** If the generators are bar-even-symmetrized so\nthat both the joint trace `j` and the product `p` are bar-even, the cumulant\n`κ = j − p` **is** bar-even — the bar-even channel the absolute scale requires. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.BarParityClusterObstruction.cumulant_not_barEven","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.BarParityClusterObstruction.cumulant_not_barEven","kind":"theorem","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/BarParityClusterObstruction.lean#L75-L84","doc":"**The I-par obstruction.** A raw-trace cumulant `κ = j − p` (`j` bar-odd joint\ntrace, `p` bar-even product) is bar-even only if `2·j = 0` — i.e. never, when the\nbar-odd joint-trace part is nonzero (and `R` is `2`-torsion-free). This is the\nbar-parity FAIL the additive-cluster negative reported. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.BarParityClusterObstruction.cumulant_barParity_mixed","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.BarParityClusterObstruction.cumulant_barParity_mixed","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/BarParityClusterObstruction.lean#L68-L73","doc":"**Mixed bar-parity of the connected cumulant.** With `j` bar-odd (the joint\n2-trace) and `p` bar-even (the product of two 1-traces), the cumulant `κ = j − p`\nhas `bar κ = −j − p`: neither `κ` (bar-even) nor `−κ` (bar-odd) in general. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.BarParityClusterObstruction.barOdd_mul_barOdd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.BarParityClusterObstruction.barOdd_mul_barOdd","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/BarParityClusterObstruction.lean#L60-L66","doc":"A product of two bar-odd elements is **bar-even** (parity `(−1)² = 1`) — the\npairwise `b₂` channel is bar-even by count. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.BarParityClusterObstruction.barEven_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.BarParityClusterObstruction.barEven_mul","kind":"theorem","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/BarParityClusterObstruction.lean#L54-L58","doc":"A product of two bar-even elements is bar-even. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.BarParityClusterObstruction.sym_barEven","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.BarParityClusterObstruction.sym_barEven","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/BarParityClusterObstruction.lean#L47-L52","doc":"**Symmetrization is bar-even.** `t + bar t` is fixed by an involutive `bar`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.BarParityClusterObstruction.BarOdd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.BarParityClusterObstruction.BarOdd","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/BarParityClusterObstruction.lean#L44-L45","doc":"`t` is negated by the bar involution. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.BarParityClusterObstruction.BarEven","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.BarParityClusterObstruction.BarEven","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/BarParityClusterObstruction.lean#L41-L42","doc":"`t` is fixed by the bar involution. ","signatureChunk":0}]}